      "created_at": "2019-08-06T20:09:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The Concept: The chip are down, things look dire, the player heroes are in rough shape. Suddenly, Darkwatch arrives to turn the tide! Heroes make cameos all the time in comic books. How can we represent this in SCRPG?</p>\n<p>The Original Idea: Taking my lead from Stolen Legacy, the GM has the option to call in [Spoiler] as a d12 Lieutenant in the final fight, who alternates between Attack and Boost actions. Can we expand this to cover all heroes, and if so, can we agree on a system to implement it?</p>\n<p>The Unknown: This could all be covered in the Core Book, and we’ve never seen it discussed. So this could all be pointless theory crafting, but hey, that’s what we're here for, right? So, ideas?&nbsp;</p>",
