      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Anubis\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/anubis/48/4949_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Anubis:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Um they do it in Urban Infestation btw</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Adding to the confusion. In Stolen Legacy, it’s a Hero as Lieutenant that shows up. In Urban Infestation, it’s Heroes with Preset Abilities in the fight. I really hope they clarify this in the Core Book.</p>",
